---
interface Props {
  title?: string;
  nowGrBillions?: string;
  futureLabel?: string;
}
const {
  title = "Current Revenue → Future Revenue",
  nowGrBillions = "~$6.49B",
  futureLabel = "Reserved engine cash + Fund income (COUNTABLE only when cleared)",
} = Astro.props;
---

<figure class="viz viz--bridge" data-viz="revenue-bridge" id="revenue-bridge">
  <figcaption class="viz__cap">
    <span class="viz__family">{title}</span>
    <span class="viz__q">What happens if we change the structure?</span>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="bridge-grid">
    <div class="bridge-col">
      <h3>Arkansas NOW</h3>
      <p>
        General Revenue distributed to agencies/institutions: <strong>{nowGrBillions}</strong> (FY2026
        Allocation A). Operating road — keep paved.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Labor / consumption / other tax bases</li>
        <li>Federal & dedicated streams (partially outside this seed)</li>
        <li>Appropriation machine → DHS, education, corrections…</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="bridge-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
    <div class="bridge-col bridge-col--future">
      <h3>Constitutional Capitalism</h3>
      <p>{futureLabel}</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Ten-engine public income stack</li>
        <li>Prosperity Fund compounding</li>
        <li>External-income ownership/participation</li>
        <li>Ordinary wages & homes exit only after cash clears</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="viz__note">
    Dependency Rule: build the prosperity-funded bridge before removing the old tax road. COUNTABLE
    engines remain $0 — this diagram is structural, not a revenue claim.
  </p>
</figure>
